<<character Alisa appearance:Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off>>
<<character AnAn appearance:Default,ArmR-Option-Off,Angle01/Option_Arms->>
Leia: 接下来，我们要从什么话题开始讨论呢？ #line:0101Trial00_Leia001

Sherry: 那当然是，能明确指出凶手的证据了！ #line:0101Trial00_Sherry001

Alisa: 有那玩意也用不着我们想这么辛苦了。 #line:0101Trial00_Alisa001

<<character Sherry appearance:Smile>>
Sherry: 哼哼哼，如果我说存在这样的证据呢？ #line:0101Trial00_Sherry002

<<character Alisa appearance:Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off>>
Alisa: ……比如尸体上写了凶手的名字？ #line:0101Trial00_Alisa002

<<character Coco appearance:Angry>>
Coco: 要是有这种证据，大家早就发现了！ #line:0101Trial00_Coco001

<<character Miria appearance:Surprised1,ArmR2,ArmL2>>
Miria: 别急嘛。[br /]先听听小莉她[br /]是怎么讲的，好吗？ #line:0101Trial00_Miria001

Miria: 反正我也不知道[br /]该从哪里开始讨论…… #line:0101Trial00_Miria002

<<character Leia appearance:Normal1,ArmR3>>

// Prepare A while B is displayed, then cut to the moving close-up.
<<camera view:main preset:leia_close center:245.625,78 via:cut>>
<<beat begin>>
<<camera move view:main preset:leia_close duration:0.6 ease:cubic-out>>
<<screen show main via:cut>>
<<beat end wait:false>>
<<wait 0.2>>
Leia: 好，那就拜托雪莉你讲一下，[br /]你找到的证据是什么。 #line:0101Trial00_Leia002

<<character Sherry appearance:Default,ArmR12>>

<<camera view:trial_b preset:sherry_close center:176.25,78 via:cut>>
<<beat begin>>
<<camera view:trial_b preset:sherry_close via:cut>>
<<screen show trial_b via:cut>>
<<beat end wait:false>>
<<wait 0.2>>
Sherry: 好的！交给我吧！ #line:0101Trial00_Sherry003

<<character Ema appearance:Pensive1,ArmR3>>

<<camera view:main preset:ema_medium via:cut>>
<<beat begin>>
<<camera move view:main preset:ema_close duration:4 ease:sine-out>>
<<screen show main via:cut>>
<<beat end wait:false>>
<<wait 0.2>>
Ema: （接下来讨论要真正开始了……[br /]　我得认真听大家讲的话……） #line:0101Trial00_Ema001

Ema: （可是我到底应该说什么话才好呢……？） #line:0101Trial00_Ema002

<<sfx Sfx_Common_001 volume:1>>
<<character Meruru appearance:Normal1,ArmR7_1,ArmL5,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open2>>

// Meruru on the left, Ema on the right. Shared Stage, independent cameras.
<<camera view:trial_b preset:meruru_split via:cut>>
<<camera view:main preset:ema_close via:cut>>
<<screen split left:trial_b right:main divider:25 angle:10 leftAt:20,50 rightAt:50,50 via:dissolve duration:0.2 wait:true>>
// Save at a settled dialogue boundary; active camera motion cannot be captured.
// <<autoSave>>
Meruru: ……啊，那个，艾玛小姐。 #line:0101Trial00_Meruru001

<<character Ema appearance:Surprised1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01~Mouth01_Pensive_Open>>
Ema: 啊……梅露露，[br /]你喊我有什么事？ #line:0101Trial00_Ema003

<<character Meruru appearance:Normal1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open2>>

// The original camera pulls back from Ema to the adjacent pair over eight seconds.
// Keep the current Ema pose when removing the split; do not cut to Meruru.
<<beat begin id:meruru_explanation>>
<<camera move view:main preset:pair_wide duration:8 ease:sine-in-out>>
<<screen show main via:cut>>
<<beat end wait:false>>
<<wait 0.2>>
Meruru: 我想，接下来大家要开始[br /]【讨论】了…… #line:0101Trial00_Meruru002

<<character Meruru appearance:Normal1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open2>>
Meruru: 在大家的讲话内容之中……[br /]应该会出现一些[br /]你【在意的地方】。 #line:0101Trial00_Meruru003

<<character Meruru appearance:Normal1,ArmR1_1,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Smile_Closed1>>
Meruru: 如果出现这样的地方……[br /]请你思考一下[br /]可不可以【指出】这些地方。 #line:0101Trial00_Meruru004

<<character Meruru appearance:Normal1,ArmR1_1,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Smile_Closed1>>
Meruru: 如果是错误的见解，[br /]你应该可以反驳它们。 #line:0101Trial00_Meruru005

<<character Meruru appearance:Normal1,ArmR5_1,ArmL2,Eyes1_Pensive_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open1>>
Meruru: 大家可能会有[br /]认知或者理解错误的地方…… #line:0101Trial00_Meruru006

<<character Meruru appearance:Normal1,ArmR5_1,ArmL2,Eyes1_Pensive_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open1>>
Meruru: 或许连我也会[br /]说出一些不太对劲的发言…… #line:0101Trial00_Meruru007

<<character Meruru appearance:Normal2,ArmR9_2,ArmL9,Eyes2_Smile_Closed1,Mouth2_Smile_Closed1>>
Meruru: 但我相信，艾玛小姐你[br /]一定可以将大家的讨论[br /]引导至正确的方向……！ #line:0101Trial00_Meruru008

<<sfx Sfx_Common_001 volume:1>>
<<character Meruru appearance:Smile>>
Meruru: ……虽然，这只是我的感觉。 #line:0101Trial00_Meruru009

<<character Ema appearance:Normal1>>
<<beat join meruru_explanation>>
// <<autoSave>>
Ema: 梅露露……！ #line:0101Trial00_Ema004


<<camera view:trial_b preset:ema_close via:cut>>
<<beat begin>>
<<character Ema appearance:Determined2,ArmR3,ArmL7 via:cut>>
<<camera move view:trial_b preset:ema_close zoom:2.88 duration:2 ease:sine-out>>
<<screen show trial_b via:cut>>
<<beat end wait:false>>
<<wait 0.2>>
Ema: （正如梅露露所说，如果出现了在意的地方，[br /]　就试着拿出勇气指出它们吧……！） #line:0101Trial00_Ema005

